---
title: "end (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: authorized party invokes end()
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller authorized
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale already ended
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert AlreadyEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_end: sale not ended
    q_end --> [*]: saleEnded = true; emit SaleEnded()

    note right of q_end
        INV-001: Sale end is manual, not time-based
        INV-002: Ending the sale triggers refund period commencement
    end note
